extraction_notes: "Rifts World Book 15: Spirit West printed 48-53, read from the text layer. Printed 51 is glyph-corrupt, and the text layer sets the hit point multiplier as a backslash; read off a 200 dpi render as P.E. x5, +3D6 per level, with S.D.C. P.E. x2 - both stated, so this class needs no CORE_SDC_BY_CLASS entry. The +2 P.E. and +4 P.S. from Strength of the Trees are attribute bonuses. Spells: five of the eleven Shamanistic Plant spells at level one, the remaining six at level two, then one per level from the printed 52 list (list B). The book caps each later pick at the character''s own level on that list; a named list replaces the spell-level gate in this app, so the cap is shown to the player as a note on each grant rather than enforced. Tongues appears twice on that list and is stored once. Three names use the catalog''s spelling: Negate Poison/Toxin, Reduce Self (6 inches) and Summon and Control Rain, the last matching the book''s level 12 and 200 P.P.E. The trade goods print as 2D6xlOO and are read as 2D6x100 (BOOK-INGEST-AUDIT F53). The totem pick is not stored; see BOOK-INGEST-AUDIT.md F56. The book gives no starting fetishes for this class; its fetish making is a special ability."
